 "remarks": "Spacious and bright 3-bedroom apartment featuring generously sized bedrooms and plenty of natural light. The primary bedroom offers a walk-in closet, while the other two bedrooms each feature double closets for ample storage. Recently painted with a brand-new electric stove. The apartment is fully electric, with individual heating controls in each room for personalized temperature control and more efficient heating use. Conveniently located near public transportation and just minutes from the train station, with easy access to Grand Central and NYC. Nearby laundromat and reserved parking included. Great commuter location! No pets",
